85e6ddd4a57b72.jpg","https://so5.360tres.com/t0172a8ca38eced2a09.jpg","https://so5.360tres.com/t019174f6c3c56ab4d7.jpg","https://so5.360tres.com/t0124cc73aadf9cf2ba.jpg"],"user":"北侠西狂","rate":4},{"content":"淮海路这个厉峰双别墅也是历史保护建筑，建筑很有看点，很有异国风情，周边交通也便利，因为在淮海路商业街，所以周边吃喝玩乐也很多。","time":"2020年1月01日","avatar":"","imgs":["https://so5.360tres.com/t01b467f512f05884ce.jpg","https://so5.360tres.com/t01683397d75721a902.jpg","https://so5.360tres.com/t01b524531c211ad458.jpg"],"user":"M22****3363","rate":4},{"content":"淮海路796历峰双墅很别致，玉立的楼阁，先进的建筑。","time":"2018年5月23日","avatar":"","imgs":[],"user":"快乐是永远","rate":5},{"content":"这里的环境优美大家一起来了。。。。。。","time":"2018年6月17日","avatar":"","imgs":[],"user":"紫贝壳紫贝壳","rate":5}],"poi_type":"","notes":[{"jump_url":"https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/tripshoot/paipai/detail/detail?articleId=241958977&amp;isHideNavBar=YES&amp;seo=0&amp;allianceid=12710&amp;sid=24500016&amp;popup=close","author_name":"艺游上海的钦钦","favorites_count":90,"publish_time":1765788813,"album":[{"imgs":["https://so5.360tres.com/t11e11c8c9566977aff48707ecd.jpg","https://so5.360tres.com/t11e11c8c954afc0f2bfaa8ce01.jpg","https://so5.360tres.com/t11e11c8c95d6e7cdea6b7e5105.jpg"]}],"content":"历峰双子别墅小花园美得像打翻的油画盘! 这里藏着小溪和迷你瀑布, 水声轻轻柔柔的~ 枫叶红得热烈, ...","review_count":259,"cover_pic":"https://so5.360tres.com/t11e11c8c9566977aff48707ecd.jpg","title":"居然在历峰双子别墅外遇到了一整个秋天🍂!","id":"241958977"}],"update_master_time":1742792612,"primary":"ctrip","poi_name":"淮海路796历峰双墅","mtime":1793193209,"primary_id":"31669226","primary_src":"ctrip_sight","update_time":1742792612,"datasource":"yunying360","flag":3,"ctrip_status":1,"review_count":9,"highlight_list":[],"stags":[{"tag":"历史建筑","level":9}],"insert_time":1793193209,"name":"历峰双子别墅","themes":["历史建筑"],"avg_rating":4.2,"ctrip_tags":[{"key":"SalesGroup","tags":[{"key":"PriceFromTag","value":"4"}]},{"key":"ScenicSpotThemeGroup","tags":[{"key":"153","value":"历史建筑"}]}],"review_murl":"https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/comment/2/2037100-sight.html?allianceid=12710&amp;sid=465