um/detail/pid=13f12c1e57ecc860&amp;imgurl=https%3A%2F%2Fso5.360tres.com%2Fdmfd%2F220_165_%2Ft01bb9e0f1f4485b34f.jpg"></a></li></ul></div><div><h5>营业时间</h5><div class="ubkfVKHhyglR3HvPBMQGN">具体营业状态以当天开放情况为准<br/></div></div><div class="_2iOYQLCwfwqgi6ZJwHFjun" id="review"><h5>网友评论·<!-- -->9<!-- -->条评论<a data-log="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;details_reviews_all&quot;}" data-style="more" href="https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/comment/2/2037100-sight.html?allianceid=12710&amp;sid=465583">查看更多</a></h5><div></div><ul class="_1XwMsbH2PQDVKsWamkXr6Z"><li data-showall="0"><a class="iyDC28TQHMDbCdB3PT6LQ" href="https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/comment/2/2037100-sight.html?allianceid=12710&amp;sid=465583"><div class="_1Nh_YBeVOdXjkQmlW8ZLfT"></div><div>携程用户</div><div><span data-module="star" class="_22NaPsKCnxrC_DYGevRU_s margin5"><em class="_1aBL2zT5hznP2fqj8R0Utu" style="width:40px"></em></span><span class="G2yr8S9lrbddFMP-ORJMc">2024年6月18日</span></div><div data-log="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;details_reviews_all&quot;}" class="_20-aHY5V5dkMTEQSMlUHu3">淮海路796历峰双墅，来看尚绿之境展来的。门口有历峰双子别墅介绍这是一座新古典主义风格的华丽建筑，由两幢几近对称的四层建筑组成，东翼建于1921年，西翼建于1927年，中央通过连廊街接。它的南立面正对一座风景宜人的花园。这座因浑然一体的两翼而得名的建筑由通和洋行设计。<span class="_2hOVvDHmXJstohv5_Aga0L"></span></div></a><div data-log="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;details_reviews_pic&quot;}" class="esBmassdAtKc_mFept0Bf"><a style="background-image:url(https://so5.360tres.com/dmfd/196_196_/t11e11c8c95b77a964c4533a44d.jpg)" href="/m/album/detail/pid=13f12c1e57ecc860&amp;imgurl=https%3A%2F%2Fso5.360tres.com%2Fdmfd%2F196_196_%2Ft11e11c8c95b77a964c4533a44d.jpg"></a><a style="background-image:url(https://so5.360tres.com/dmfd/196_196_/t11e11c8c953efe634744410acf.jpg)" href="/m/album/detail/pid=13f12c1e57ecc860&amp;imgurl=https%3A%2F%2Fso5.360tres.com%2Fdmfd%2F196_196_%2Ft11e11c8c953efe634744410acf.jpg"></a><a style="background-image:url(https://so5.360tres.com/dmfd/196_196_/t11e11c8c954ee031ed389f0cbb.jpg)" href="/m/album/detail/pid=13f12c1e57ecc860&amp;imgurl=https%3A%2F%2Fso5.360tres.com%2Fdmfd%2F196_196_%2Ft11e11c8c954ee031ed389f0cbb.jpg"></a></div></li><li data-showall="0"><a class="iyDC28TQHMDbCdB3PT6LQ" href="https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/comment/2/2037100-sight.html?allianceid=12710&amp;sid=465583"><div class="_1Nh_YBeVOdXjkQmlW8ZLfT"></div><div>携程用户</div><div><span data-module="star" class="_22NaPsKCnxrC_DYGevRU_s margin5"><em class="_1aBL2zT5hznP2fqj8R0Utu" style="width:54px"></em></span><span class="G2yr8S9lrbddFMP-ORJMc">2020年6月21日</span></div><div data-log="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;details_reviews_all&quot;}" class="_20-aHY5V5dkMTEQSMlUHu3">淮海中路796号的双子别墅，是两幢空中走廊连接的花园别墅，最早是沪上知名买办姜炳生的宅邸。按照当时流行的新古典主义风格，四层高，有纤细华丽的列柱，连续敞廊、大装饰玻璃。东楼建于1921年，西楼建于1927年。<span class="_2hOVvDHmXJstohv5_Aga0L"></span></div></a><div data-log="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;details_reviews_pic&quot;}" class="esBmassdAtKc_mFept0Bf"><a style="background-image:url(https://so5.360tres.com/dmfd/196_196_/t015c85e6ddd4a57b72.jpg)" href="/m/album/detail/pid=13f12c1e57ecc860&amp;imgurl=https%3A%2F%2Fso5.360tres.com%2Fdmfd%2F196_196_%2Ft015c85e6ddd4a57b72.jpg"></a><a style="background-image:url(https://so5.360tres.com/dmfd/196_196_/t0172a8ca38eced2a09.jpg)" href="/m/album/detail/pid=13f12c1e57ecc860&amp;imgurl=https%3A%2F%2Fso5.360tres.com%2Fdmfd%2F196_196_%2Ft0172a8ca38eced2a09.jpg"></a><a style="background-image:url(https://so5.360tres.com/dmfd/196_196_/t019174f6c3c56ab4d7.jpg)" href="/m/album/detail/pid=13f12c1e57ecc860&amp;imgurl=https%3A%2F%2Fso5.360tres.com%2Fdmfd%2F196_196_%2Ft019174f6c3c56ab4d7.jpg"></a></div></li><li data-showall="0"><a class="iyDC28TQHMDbCdB3PT6LQ" href="https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/comment/2/2037100-sight.html?allianceid=12710&amp;sid=465583"><div class="_1Nh_YBeVOdXjkQmlW8ZLfT"></div><div>携程用户</div><div><span data-module="star" class="_22NaPsKCnxrC_DYGevRU_s margin5"><em class="_1aBL2zT5hznP2fqj8R0Utu" style="width:54px"></em></span><span class="G2yr8S9lrbddFMP-ORJMc">2020年1月01日</span></div><div data-log="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;details_reviews_all&